# jobs J2 real-world check, 2026-10-09, Mac, scratch prod stack

## Stack
docker compose -p jobapp-j2scratch -f compose.yml -f <scratchpad>/compose.j2.yml up -d --build --wait
  (compose.j2.yml renames the images to jobapp-j2scratch-{api,caddy}:latest so the shared tags are
  not touched; .env of the worktree: APP_ENV=production, HTTP_PORT=8097, fresh random SECRET_KEY
  and database password) -> redis, db, api, caddy Healthy
docker compose ... exec -T api alembic upgrade head  -> 0001 to 0004
docker compose ... exec -T api python -m app.identity.cli create-admin <alice scratch account>
docker compose ... exec -T api python -m app.identity.cli create-admin <bob scratch account>
Removed afterwards: docker compose -p jobapp-j2scratch ... down -v (that scratch project only).

## Conversion on the Mac (Harald's ../data, read only)
uv run --native-tls --directory api python -m app.jobs.cli convert --source-dir ../../data --out <scratchpad>/jobs.json
  Converted 433 rows (applied 29, closed 6, cv_ready 3, found 158, interview 2, shortlisted 146,
  skipped 60, staged 29), 395 posting texts, 330 files, 0 warnings, 18.5 MB.

